                                "type": "text",
                                "text": " work \u2014 is something Jimmy has been encouraging us to try for a while now, and I think it turned out fabulously. And we couldn't have asked for a better first guest \u2014 or a worse first work. Enjoy!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
